# Code owners for the release QA admission and ownership policy (gap C4-02).
# These files decide which builds are admitted to release, which QA floor applies and who may
# change them, so a change to any of them needs the owner's review. Ownership binds only when
# branch protection on the default branch requires code-owner review; without that setting
# GitHub shows the owner but does not block the merge.
# scripts/ci/codeowners.test.mjs holds this file: every policy file must be listed with an owner,
# and every concrete path listed here must exist, so a rename cannot silently drop the protection.
/packages/release/qa-admission-policy.json @bogusyogi
/packages/release/release-qa-floor.json @bogusyogi
/packages/release/rightkit-ownership.json @bogusyogi
/packages/release/devtools-policy.json @bogusyogi
/packages/release/release-qa-policy.mjs @bogusyogi
/packages/release/release-qa-hardening.mjs @bogusyogi
/packages/release/release-qa-audit.mjs @bogusyogi
/packages/release/release-qa-receipt.mjs @bogusyogi
/packages/release/ownership-policy-bundle.mjs @bogusyogi
/.github/CODEOWNERS @bogusyogi
